<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96968" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ,= <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			, <i>garment, robe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1491
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.27
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				6178
			</span></i> (Egypt, metr.), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεβρῶν
				στολίδες</span>, i.e. fawnskins <i>worn as garments</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1359
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sails,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				10.6
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Satyr.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pl.,
				<i>folds</i> in a woman's robe, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέπλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					936
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀνδριάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Aud.</u>
					802a38
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολιδωτός</span>: of
				<i>wrinkles</i> or <i>folds</i> in the womb or other parts,
				<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.8.14
			</span></i>; of rugose ulcers, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.231
			</span></i>, al.; also <i>wrinkles</i> on the forehead, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.46
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.64a
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
